---
import Carousel from 'astro-media-kit/components/Carousel.astro'
import Image from 'astro-media-kit/components/Image.astro'
import Picture from 'astro-media-kit/components/Picture.astro'
import Video from 'astro-media-kit/components/Video.astro'
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { pages } from '../pages'

const { title } = pages.find((p) => p.href === '/carousel')!
---

<Layout {title}>
	<h1>{title}</h1>

	<h2>1. Pictures with captions and dots</h2>
	<p class="note">
		Swipe, drag with the mouse, use the buttons or the arrow keys. The slides share
		<code>zoom="album"</code>, so a click opens them together in the lightbox, which returns onto
		the slide it was showing.
	</p>
	<Carousel captions dots label="Album">
		<Picture alt="JPEG photo" src="../assets/test.jpeg" zoom="album" zoomLevel="native">
			A photo, with its caption below.
		</Picture>
		<Picture alt="SVG tiger" formats={{ svg: ['svg'] }} src="../assets/tiger.svg" zoom="album">
			A tiger, as vectors.
		</Picture>
		<Picture
			alt="Dark mode JPEG"
			src="../assets/test.jpeg"
			srcDark="../assets/test-dark.jpeg"
			zoom="album"
		>
			A photo that follows the color scheme.
		</Picture>
	</Carousel>

	<h2>2. Mixed media, captions hidden</h2>
	<p class="note">
		Without <code>captions</code>, the captions stay out of the carousel and appear in the lightbox
		only. The video keeps its controls, and its sound fades while the lightbox shows a neighbor.
	</p>
	<Carousel dots label="Mixed">
		<Image alt="JPEG photo" src="../assets/test.jpeg" zoom="mixed">
			The first slide.
		</Image>
		<Video src="/test.mp4" zoom="mixed">
			A local video.
		</Video>
		<Image alt="SVG tiger" src="../assets/tiger.svg" zoom="mixed" />
	</Carousel>

	<h2>3. A lone slide</h2>
	<p class="note">No buttons, no dots, and no script.</p>
	<Carousel>
		<Image alt="JPEG photo" src="../assets/test.jpeg" zoom />
	</Carousel>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(.amk-carousel) {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid light-dark(#ddd, #333);
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
	}

	:global(.amk-carousel-slide) {
		padding: 1rem;
	}

	:global(.amk-carousel img) {
		max-width: 100%;
	}
</style>
